{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 おつかれさま"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/29/5894546/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ−だよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/29/5894546/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週のNOGIBINGO!3で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の ぺろぺろが放送されてしまいましたね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～ NOGIBINGOスタッフさんは優しいですね。。。嬉しゅうキモチ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/29/5894546/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はお仕事の前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと油そばを食べに行ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴルフの練習をしたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、らりんと七瀬と3人で映画「神様の言うとおり」を観てきたよ～.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダルマさんが転んだ～（＾ω＾）のやつね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか新しい感じの映画やったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白かったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬と車の中で～.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/29/5894546/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車の中 暗いね.＊笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/29/5894546/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"... 紅白のことなんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはりファンの皆さん，家族，友達，，沢山の人が楽しみにしてくださっていたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出場できなくなって悔しい気持ちもありますが、私の個人的な想いは書かないことにします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ミュージックステーション スペシャルLIVEに乃木坂46が出演することになりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しいです（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2014年 ラストスパートも頑張っていきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし。大好きだよ❤️？"}],"source":"archive"}